{"title":"Feather Birdies🏸 Sunday Morning Badminton Meetup!","startsAt":"2026-10-04T09:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-04T12:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"-**$10** per person (please bring one brand new standard feather birdie)\n-OR **$13** per person (Tiger to provide one brand new standard feather birdie)\n-Plastic birdies can still be provided after the feather birdies are used up.\n\n**Attention !!! please let us know at least 48 hours (Friday@3PM) in advance if you or your guest can’t make it. This gives those on the waitlist a chance to join! Please note that \"no-shows\" or late cancellations are tracked; even a single occurrence may result in removal from the group to ensure active participation. Thanks for your cooperation!**","venue":{"name":"Tiger badminton","address":"7755 warden ave, Unit 7, Markham","lat":43.83723,"lng":-79.32842,"city":"Markham"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto-GTA Badminton Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/7/9/1/highres_535278321.jpeg"}